Note: `(99, 1, 2)` has length 3 — passes the incomplete check, then kind 99 → "Unknown item". Good.

`(ATTR,)` has length 1 → incomplete. Good.

Order of checks: first incomplete (len < 3), then per-type length check, then unknown. For `(99, 1, 2)` — length 3, kind unknown → "Unknown item". Good.

